Keyboard Render Kit 2 documentation — unofficial multi-language build
===============================================================================

Short version: the documentation belongs to ImperfectLink, the translations and
the build additions belong to E3e, and the bundled theme/font assets keep their
own open-source licences. This repository is not affiliated with ImperfectLink
or with Blender.

一句话说明：文档内容版权归 ImperfectLink；翻译与构建部分由 E3e 制作；主题与
字体等第三方素材沿用各自的开源授权。本仓库与原作者及 Blender 官方无关。


1. Documentation content and images
-----------------------------------

The English documentation text, screenshots and other assets are
© 2022 ImperfectLink, all rights reserved. They were originally published at
https://keyboardrenderkit.readthedocs.io/ (Keyboard Render Kit 2 v2.0.1).

This repository contains an unofficial, non-commercial mirror of that content
with community translations added. No ownership of the original content is
claimed here, and no additional rights to it are granted by this repository.
All rights remain with ImperfectLink. If the author asks for the mirror to be
changed or removed, it will be.


2. Translations and build additions
-----------------------------------

© 2026 E3e <https://github.com/Ephem-eral>, released under the MIT licence:

  * the Simplified Chinese hand-proofread edition, the Traditional Chinese
