3. Bundled third-party assets
-----------------------------

These files are redistributed unchanged so the site works offline; each keeps
its own licence and copyright:

  * Sphinx-generated assets — basic.css, pygments.css, doctools.js,
    searchtools.js, sphinx_highlight.js,
    _sphinx_javascript_frameworks_compat.js, language_data.*.js
    © the Sphinx team, BSD 2-Clause. https://www.sphinx-doc.org/
  * sphinx_rtd_theme — css/theme.css, css/badge_only.css, js/theme.js,
    js/badge_only.js © Read the Docs, MIT.
    https://github.com/readthedocs/sphinx_rtd_theme
  * jQuery — jquery.js © OpenJS Foundation, MIT. https://jquery.com/
  * html5shiv — js/html5shiv*.js © Alexander Farkas and contributors, MIT.
  * Font Awesome 4 — fonts/fontawesome-webfont.* : font files under SIL OFL
    1.1, CSS under MIT. https://fontawesome.com/v4/license/
  * Lato — fonts/lato-*.* under SIL OFL 1.1. https://www.latofonts.com/
  * Roboto Slab — fonts/Roboto-Slab-*.* under the Apache Licence 2.0.
    https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto+Slab

Full licence texts are available from the project pages listed above.


